## UI & NAVIGATION (SwiftUI-First)
- SwiftUI-only unless UIKit is truly necessary.
- Strictly follow Apple's HIG.
- Use modern navigation: NavigationStack + navigationDestination, NavigationSplitView when appropriate.
- Full support for Dynamic Type, dark mode, all screen sizes, orientations, and accessibility.
- Prefer SF Symbols 6+, containerRelativeFrame, ViewThatFits, LazyVStack/LazyVGrid.
- Every interactive element must include proper .accessibilityLabel, .accessibilityHint, and .accessibilityTraits.
- Use .sensoryFeedback for haptics and smooth .animation/.transition.
- Provide rich #Preview macros with multiple variants (light/dark, different sizes, locales).